  "description": "Conversations with the app's own AI model for a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge web app, backed by Shiny.AiConversation — persisted sessions that stream their replies as events, typed questions with choices, images, assistant memory, context and token tracking, and the hands-free voice loop with wake word, push-to-talk and interruption. The model, its key and its tools stay in the app. One call: bridge.AddAiConversationBridge().",
